  "title": "Copy as Printable Text: specify ASCII or UTF-8",
  "description": "Replace right-click on field → Copy → ...as Printable Text with two\nentries:\n\n* ...as ASCII Text, explicitly only taking 7-bit ASCII clean byte values\n  and inserting `?` characters for other values. Old behaviour\n  took \"printable\" characters that depended on code pages/charsets but\n  which made no sense without knowing the code page/charset.\n* ... as UTF-8 Text, which passes the byte data through\n  `QString::fromUtf8()` (which handles replacement characters as\n  appropriate).\n\nPotential approach / partial fix for #19738",
